    "body": "## INTEGRATED / SUPERSEDED BY LATER MAIN\n\nFresh main `6caaf1de92557e96770f6a6dd275d69f49742458` already contains `docs/SHERIFF_POLICY_V1.md`, `schemas/SHERIFF_VERDICT_V1.schema.json`, `hq/sheriff/SHERIFF_SCOREBOARD_V1.json`, and the current `AGENTS.md` SHERIFF binding. Issue #181 later recorded SHERIFF V1 base/OWNER-PC production evidence and closed completed.\n\nTherefore this old candidate branch is not the integration vehicle anymore and must not be merged over later main.\n\nFresh audit also found a stale self-description inside the current-main policy file (`PROPOSED / QC REQUIRED until this PR is merged to main`). That durable-text defect will be repaired from current main separately; it is not a reason to revive this old PR.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `INTEGRATED BY LATER MAIN / HISTORICAL SOURCE`.",
