    "body": "SHERIFF_POLICY_V1 implementation.\n\nDesign: durable SHERIFF governance policy with separate discipline and skill ratings, evidence-bound verdicts for every incident, reuse-first discipline, independent AUTHOR/QC/SHERIFF separation, regression-test learning loop, neutral bootstrap scoreboard, and future Glicko-2-style league rating.\n\nTDD evidence:\n- RED HEAD `0a842d18013c5df861dee187626f95c381df3c98`\n- RED hq-validate run `33242797988` = FAILURE exactly because policy/schema/scoreboard/AGENTS bindings did not yet exist.\n- GREEN HEAD `c516ed77fefa1b71508311f9acd6f00f4906f7f7`\n- GREEN hq-validate run `33242875506` = SUCCESS.\n- Jobs PASS: hq-schema (full unittest suite + hq_validate), hq-scope-guard, hq-control-tower-integrity.\n\nFresh exact-HEAD read-back verified:\n- `docs/SHERIFF_POLICY_V1.md`\n- `schemas/SHERIFF_VERDICT_V1.schema.json`\n- `hq/sheriff/SHERIFF_SCOREBOARD_V1.json`\n- `AGENTS.md`\n\nMerge only against expected HEAD `c516ed77fefa1b71508311f9acd6f00f4906f7f7`.",
